                        "jpn": "卓球歴六十年の技 - それぞれのヤル気"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Mr Shibazaki get a new manager for the club. It turns out to be a girl that Takeda knows from his childhood, Kyoko Iwashita. A few days later they get the news that they have to play against the favorite in the coming championship. Kyoko thinks of a plan to motivate the club.",
