                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "The team discovers that Maeno has used the remainder of the club's new ping pong balls for a very non-ping-pong-related purpose.  The team pools money to purchase new balls and uses paper-rock-scissors to select who will actually go and make the purchase.  However, Izawa expresses concern as Maeno was the one randomly selected.",
